            "review_title": "Review at 2H Coffee",
            "review_text": "christopher D\n8 contributions\n0\nFantastic coffee for a Melbourne coffee lover.\nMar 2026 • Friends\nMy first coffee in Vietnam that had latte art plus the milk was perfectly aerated and the perfect drinking temperature; the egg coffee was very good, with a creamer thicker head; the brown coffee was strong just with the bitterness knocked off with a touch of brown sugar, the milky tea was so good and creamy too. So it was 4 out of 4 for our group. Fun watching the traffic from here too.\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
