            "review_title": "Review at 2H Coffee",
            "review_text": "Adam G\nKungalv, Sweden10 contributions\n1\nCoffee for 2 at 2h.\nOct 2019 • Couples\nIt's a bit on the pricey side but oh my gosh does this coffee taste good!\n\nWe had the hot vietnamese egg coffee and cold traditional vietnamese coffee with condensed milk and they were both excellent! I'd rate the egg coffee a bit higher.\n\nStaff were nice and friendly. Owner also takes some stunning pictures that he showed us!\n\nOverall a great experience!\n\nPs. We were at the showroom at 64 hang quat St, so not actually this one!!\nRead more\nWritten October 7, 2019",
